{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c50d0b10cacf2d2dcb4c43d88e4fcdc276ab010e062cca1f2e5bf57e64ee3961", "ja": "（あれ？　まだレッスン室に誰か残ってるみたいだな。\nたしか今日使ってるのは……）", "zh": "（咦？好像还有谁留在练习室里。\n我记得今天使用这里的是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "ab0bd05c2cd1d4b2700b18715d0634e26fcb59cd99e845909bd5cf4e47017fb2", "ja": "「こ、こっちに来ないでください！　それ以上\n近づいたら……雷を落とします……！」", "zh": "“请、请不要过来！再靠近的话……我就要降下雷电了……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "d0a02d3409d49d11a7eaa2c082d1c798abbf59017c8e9f68e377043d51657fb9", "ja": "「ダ、ダメ。人間に近寄られたら……足が震えて」\nあっ、{$P$}。お疲れさまです！", "zh": "“不、不行。被人类靠近的话……脚就会发抖”\n啊，{$P$}。您辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1003_p", "source_sha256": "28a501178d655e48d966efc24ade3722bfc9f72e769ce2f880813413910f063c", "ja": "お疲れ様。今、練習してたのって\nもしかして、今度演じるモンスターの？", "zh": "辛苦了。你刚才练习的，难道是下次要扮演的怪兽？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "6b845827d4942e9f0e8b5e2334ff8409aa9e89fa2554d3c5333324211f6be8a5", "ja": "はい。人型モンスターの雷竜です。\n人間と遭遇するシーンの練習をしてました。", "zh": "是的。是人形怪物雷龙。\n我刚才在练习和人类相遇的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1005_p", "source_sha256": "175041a974ee591e7c16619cf9c28c932f116c4c834cb18e7ddf8d9bea79eeae", "ja": "確か、内気な性格なんだよな。\nうん。上手く表現できてると思うよ。", "zh": "对了，这只雷龙性格内向来着。\n嗯，我觉得你表现得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "96d4dde09bf1c39b24a8723d3de605477dea3f7709e15d8606b09b34d6d51d4d", "ja": "本当ですか？　私、この雷竜に共感しちゃって。\n少しでも魅力を見せられたらって思ったんです。", "zh": "真的吗？我特别能和这只雷龙产生共鸣。\n我想着，要是能展现出它哪怕一点魅力就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "926e227051ae7421438d24e117f3aa785b86ad8c6cbdc29c26b2ed7a16f7180c", "ja": "ふふっ、たくさん自主練をした甲斐がありましたね。", "zh": "呵呵，看来这么多自主练习没有白费呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d7f570941ebd7335f942e594e371024d2c63575554fa962d4b8e3f5f5afdd80e", "ja": "ああ……自主練の時間が増えたと思ったのは、\nそういうことか。でも、どんなところに共感したんだ？", "zh": "啊……原来觉得自主练习的时间变多了，是因为这个啊。不过，你是在哪些方面产生共鸣的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "904bdf989ca9dac495b3ab2018966d4778d1c2cad9c23012a6ceb01cc842df9a", "ja": "そうですね。\n弱さを抱えながら頑張る姿、でしょうか。", "zh": "是啊。\n大概是那种怀抱着脆弱依然努力的模样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "3a363baf8d5b6154730b604cf2473fb93dec63b3f7924ec33158e484594fe718", "ja": "人間の前だと足が震えちゃうような弱気なモンスター\nですけど……健気で、応援したくなる子なんです。", "zh": "在人类面前会害怕得双腿发抖的胆小怪兽，\n但……是个惹人怜爱、让人想为它加油的孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "d1dfab12c366667dec05c9b2b173d55585b9dd9a1f979776ce2b539b49df98c3", "ja": "最初は怖がっていた人間達に、少しずつ\n心を開いていく展開とか……私、グッときちゃって！", "zh": "看到那个怪物慢慢向曾经害怕它的人类敞开心扉的情节……我整个人都被打动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a38c91f2d590ec7705c539c4787416f050e41cb5008cbc44c0500aa79b10255c", "ja": "うんうん、わかるよ。\n王道だけど、それがまたいいんだよな。", "zh": "嗯嗯，我懂。\n虽然是王道剧情，但正因为如此才更好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "5a770ab3729fcc7969da428b79d6dc4cb2097cfe3efeb53cb363a3aa315abda9", "ja": "そうなんです。物語後半の素直になった雷竜も、\nすごく可愛いんですよね♪", "zh": "就是这样。故事后半变得坦率的雷龙，也特别可爱呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a36ea9f1878783231096033fea4b81c8d29c891e641e66293d25dea51e6741b5", "ja": "よかったな、紗代子。\n気に入ったキャラクターを演じられて。", "zh": "太好了呢，纱代子。\n能出演自己喜欢的角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0513_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0513_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "9825d46bf1e448dbb94741b524add91dfc78855fd0cfae4871c899d31464fe25", "ja": "はいっ！　私、この出会いを大切にしたいです。\n長く演じられるように……この子と一緒に頑張ります♪", "zh": "好的！我想珍惜这次相遇。\n为了能长久地饰演下去……我会和这个孩子一起努力♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
